message: "Please cite the exact commit you used; this repository is a conditional mathematical construction."
title: "Homometric motion: an exact-arithmetic conditional certificate"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Thomas"
    family-names: "Albrecht"
repository-code: "https://github.com/thequantumfalcon/homometric-motion"
url: "https://github.com/thequantumfalcon/homometric-motion"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A reproducible certificate for an explicit one-dimensional clean-homometric
  pair under specified harmonic Gaussian motion and observation assumptions. The
  construction includes covariance, exposure and frequency uncertainty and
  a conservative finite-count risk bound. It does not establish physical
  validation, novelty or practical feasibility.
keywords:
  - homometry
  - Gaussian motion
  - exact arithmetic
  - factorial cumulants
